पर्यायिन्, ई, इणी, इ, Ved. embracing, including;
going round, encompassing (in a hostile manner);
periodical.

पर्यस् 1. पर्य्-अस्, cl. 2. P. -अस्ति, Ved. to
be in the way; to surpass; to pass or spend (time);
(Sāy.) = परितो भू, to be everywhere about.

पर्य्-आप्ति, इस्, f. attaining, obtaining, acquisition;
end, conclusion, close; adequacy, competency, fitness,
dexterity; entireness, fulness, sufficiency, enough;
satisfaction, repletion, satiety; willingness, readiness;
protecting, preserving, guarding, warding off a blow,
self-defence; discrimination or distinction of objects
according to their natural properties.

पर्युपस्था पर्य्-उप-स्था, cl. 1. P. A. -तिष्-
ठति, -ते, -स्थातुम्, to stand round, surround;
wait on, serve, minister; to be present.

पर्य्-एषण, अम्, n. search, inquiry, investigation;
(आ), f. search, inquiry, research, investigation of duty
by reasoning; serving, waiting upon, service.
